lign="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133530567.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Archaeologists found a 1,500-year-old infant burial in northern Peru.  The child was buried with whistles, a rattle, and a sculptural vessel.  This burial displays patterns characteristic of the ancient Moche culture.  The discovery occurred in a residential area, offering insights into daily life.  Excavations continue to expand understanding of the Moche community.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/1500-year-old-child-burial-unearthed-in-peru-with-whistles-a-rattle-and-a-striking-sculptural-vessel-archaeologists-uncover-clues-to-an-ancient-civilisations-rituals/articleshow/133530567.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/1500-year-old-child-burial-unearthed-in-peru-with-whistles-a-rattle-and-a-striking-sculptural-vessel-archaeologists-uncover-clues-to-an-ancient-civilisations-rituals/articleshow/133530567.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T11:20:04+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133531383,imgsize-2383820.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Seven dead, nine Chinese workers missing after fire at gas chemical complex in Russia]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133530964.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A fire at a gas chemical complex in Russia's Amur region has claimed seven lives. Six Chinese nationals were among the deceased in the Tuesday incident. Nine more Chinese workers are currently missing after the blaze. The fire broke out at the facility and was later extinguished. The plant's press service confirmed the tragic events occurred.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/se